# The files under src/TanMenu.Wpf/Themes/Aero/ are COPIES of MIT-licensed files from
# https://github.com/Splitwirez/aero-theme-for-avalonia at main = a705b7c0, and each one's header
# states exactly what was changed and that nothing else was. Upstream stores them with LF endings.
# This repository has core.autocrlf on, which would rewrite them to CRLF on checkout and make that
# "nothing else was changed" claim false on every developer's disk. Pinning eol=lf here keeps the
# copies verbatim in the working tree as well as in the object database, so the claim can be
# checked with cmp against upstream at any time.
#
# Nothing outside that directory is affected: there is no wildcard rule below.
src/TanMenu.Wpf/Themes/Aero/** text eol=lf
